  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You gain the ability to shape a single veil.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Con 13 or veilweaver level 1, Wis 13 or veilweaving modifier 13.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> When this feat is selected, choose a veil from any class’s veil list. The veil must match one of the following slots: Belt, Body, Chest, Feet, Hands, Head, Headband, Neck, Shoulders, or Wrists. A veil that can be shaped in multiple slots is not eligible to be taken unless both slots are included in this list.</p>\n<p>You can shape that veil using the normal veilweaving rules. If you do not have levels in a veilweaving class, you have total veils shaped of 1 and use your Wisdom to determine the DC’s and effects of your veil abilities. If you gain any levels in a veilweaving class, your primary veilweaving attribute is determined by that class. Once chosen, the veil granted by this feat can never be changed. Your veilweaver level for this veil is equal to your character level.</p>\n<p><strong>Special:</strong> You can gain this feat multiple times. Its effects do not stack. Each time you take the feat, choose a new veil.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/akashic-feats#toc46\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
